    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an apprentice of the Seers of Sea and Sky, you learned to read small omens in the clouds above and the depths below. The organization's vast network of libraries furthered your education, and you now travel the world, offering advice and help to those who need it.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.dlq56nVcc6fgGcWx]{Arcane Omens}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> History and Insight</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulNavigators]{Navigator's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulNavigators]{Navigator's Tools}, 8 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCandle00000]{Candles}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInk00000000]{Ink}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInkPen00000]{Ink Pen}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagParchment00]{Parchment} (9 sheets), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouch}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 11 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
